   Additional terms, as section 7 of the licence permits them ((b), (c) and (e)). They
   apply to a modified version; an unmodified copy keeps the notices as it received
   them.

   (b) A modified version must keep the attribution "History Globe by Vadym Arnaut",
       with a link to https://historyglobe.app, in the notice or "about" information it
       shows its users (in the original: the Author and Build pages of the Help). It may
